    "text": "By Thomas Brown Correspondent ,\n1 days ago ELKLAND — The Coates Heritage House and Museum brought the community together for more than just a meal on Saturday, May 2. The annual community participation and recognition dinner was held at Wesley Academy and served as both a celebration and a reminder that local history does not preserve itself. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
